hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2175","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya ham us par pakday jaaengey jo ham ne jaahiliyat mein kya? Aap ne farmaya: Jo Islam mein achha karey wo us par na pakda jaaeyga jo us ne jaahiliyat mein kya. Aur jo Islam mein bura karey wo pehlay aur pichhlay donon par pakda jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 6921). Saaedi Abu Humaid se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aadmi ko Bani Sulaim key sadqaat par muqarrar kya jisey Ibn Lutbiya kaha jaata tha. Phir jab wo aaya to us se hisaab liya. Us ne kaha: Ye tumhaara maal hai aur ye tohfa hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaash tum apne baap aur apni maan key ghar mein baithey rehtey yahan tak ke tumhaarey paas tumhaara tohfa aata agar tum sachey ho! Phir Aap ne hamein khutba diya. To Allah ki hamd ki aur uski sana bayan ki. Phir farmaya: Amma baad! Beshak main tum mein se aadmi ko kaam par muqarrar karta hun us mein jo Allah ne mujhey diya hai. To wo aata hai aur kehta hai: Ye tumhaara maal hai aur ye tohfa hai jo mujhey diya gaya hai. Kaash wo apne baap aur apni maan key ghar mein baitha rehta yahan tak ke uskey paas uska tohfa aata. Aur Allah ki qasam tum mein se koi cheez na leyga uskey haq key baghair magar wo Allah se milega jabke wo use Qiyaamat key din uthaaye huey hoga. To main tum mein se kisi ko zaroor pehchaanunga jo Allah se milega jabke wo oont uthaaye huey hoga jiski aawaaz hai. Ya gaaye jiski aawaaz hai. Ya bakri jo cheekhti hai. Phir Aap ne apna haath uthaaya yahan tak ke Aapki baghal ki safedi dekhi gai. Aap farmaatey hain: Ae Allah! Kya main ne pahuncha diya! Meri aankh ka dekhna aur merey kaan ka sunna. (6979). Zabidi ne Zakaat ki kitaab key aakhir mein zikr kya: Ke unhon-ne Ibn Lutbiya ko muqarrar kya, phir jab wo aaya to us se hisaab liya. Yahaan tak sirf. Aur is hadees ko uski lambai par chhor diya. Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Taabeer ki kitaab."
